### Octopus' annual gas estimates
Octopus Energy present annual gas and electricity usage estimates in all bills:

![annual estimates in Octoput bills](800-images/030-eg-annual-est-gas-bill.png){width=50%}

The following bullets summarise the *annual esimated gas usage* given by Octopus in bills across the four or so years they have managed the account. The presumption being these form the underlying basis for their *estimated gas readings* they generate in their gas bills.

Points worthy of note - *with respect to concerns raised here*:
* the esimates figures are *consistently* high from  account takeover until the refund point. 
* there is no informnation presented in these figures that would justify the period immediately before 'the refund bill' being of any increased significance in terms of gas usage.
* that Octopus' estimates are over *twice* Ofcom's typical medium usage figures (3-bed terraced house occupied by three persons).

